68ae6fe4955216eecb9cfca1ca01c92732deb", "message": "New build", "created_at": "2026-03-20T19:26:18Z", "repo": "eclipse-chatgpt-plugin", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "040849a9f4208d6d82b88a51e652d78849db6da4", "message": "Adding new MCP tools\n\nLaunch:\n  - runJavaApplication \u2014 run with program/VM args, configurable timeout\n  - debugJavaApplication \u2014 launch in debug mode\n  - stopApplication \u2014 terminate by name match\n  - listActiveLaunches \u2014 show all running sessions\n\n  Breakpoints:\n  - toggleBreakpoint \u2014 set/remove line breakpoint\n  - setConditionalBreakpoint \u2014 breakpoint with condition expression +\nhit count\n  - listBreakpoints \u2014 show all with conditions/status\n  - removeAllBreakpoints \u2014 clear all\n\n  Debug stepping:\n  - stepOver, stepInto, stepReturn, resumeDebug\n  - getStackTrace \u2014 threads, call stack, local variables\n  - evaluateExpression \u2014 evaluate Java expressions in suspended frame\n  - hotCodeReplace \u2014 push code changes into running JVM\n\n  New tools in eclipse-ide (4 tools)\n\n  - getTypeHierarchy \u2014 supertypes, interfaces, subtypes\n  - findReferences \u2014 find all usages of a type/method/field\n  - getQuickFixes \u2014 compilation error details and suggestions\n  - getImportSuggestions \u2014 import candidates for unresolved types", "created_at": "2026-03-20T19:25:17Z", "repo": "eclipse-chatgpt-plugin", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4cae7c434f71a4dd7e6a71e62e55adee7b917e76", "message": "Adding app running and debugging MCP support", "created_at": "2026-03-20T19:17:05Z", "repo": "eclipse-chatgpt-plugin", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "370b65ff62757344080995ffaf3f06907f6e42ae", "message": "Adding applyPatch MCP tool\n\nAllows LLM to use diff format to modify files, with optional user\nconfirmation with the patch dialog.", "created_at": "2